       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Calcium-regulated membrane-binding protein whose affinity for calcium is greatly enhanced by anionic phospholipids. It binds two calcium ions with high affinity. May be involved in heat-stress response"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Heterotetramer containing 2 light chains of S100A10/p11 and 2 heavy chains of ANXA2P2/p36"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
  },
  {
   "commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION",
